Emotet is a modular malware family that begins with **phishing emails** containing malicious Office macros. Upon execution, it drops **PowerShell scripts** or **DLLs** in `%APPDATA%` or `%TEMP%`:

```
C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Temp\{random}.exe
```

Emotet uses **process hollowing** to inject into legitimate processes (e.g., `svchost.exe`) via API calls:

```cpp
CreateProcessA(NULL, "svchost.exe", NULL, NULL, TRUE, CREATE_SUSPENDED, NULL, NULL, &si, &pi);
NtUnmapViewOfSection(hProcess, baseAddress);
WriteProcessMemory(hProcess, baseAddress, malicious_code, size, NULL);
